[Lemma lem:not_a_tree_asymp_prob_pairs_1 of arXiv:2603.28936, 'Composition of random functions and word reconstruction'] For all $x,y\in[n]$ with $x\neq y$ and uniformly over $u\in [0,1]$, we have
\begin{equation}
\mathbb E\bigl[u^{d(x)+d(y)} \mathbf{1}_{x\in\mathcal{Q}_n\cap\mathcal{C}_n}\mathbf{1}_{y\in\mathcal{Q}_n}\bigr] = 
\mathbb E\bigl[u^{d(x)} \mathbf{1}_{x\in\mathcal{Q}_n\cap\mathcal{C}_n}\bigr]g_k(u\eta_k) + O\Bigl(\frac{1}{n^2}\Bigr).

\end{equation}

