body:
[Prop prop4.5 of arXiv:2411.09988, 'A Study in Markov Chains, Loop-Erased Random Walk and Loop Soups'] The following is a valid way to get the rooted loop soup.
    \begin{itemize}
        \item Choose an ordering of the vertices $\sigma$.
        \item Take a realization of the ordered loop soup with ordering $\sigma$.
        \item For each $\omega$ in the soup, choose a translation $\tau^k\omega$ where $k$ is chosen uniformly in $\{0, 1, \ldots, |\omega|-1\}$.
    \end{itemize}

