[Proposition th:tenso of arXiv:2511.05223, 'Kac's Program and Relative Entropy Decay for Nonlinear Spin-Exchange Dynamics'] Suppose $\mu\in\ensuremath{\mathcal P}(\O_{L,M})$ is strongly log-concave. Then, for any $F\in\ensuremath{\mathcal S}$, 
