[Proposition 8 of arXiv:2604.15226, '\bfseries Nonlinear Schrödinger equations with spatial white noise potential on full space'] Let $0<\mu\le1$. There exists a unique solution in $\CC(\IR,L_\mu^2(\IR^d)\cap H^1(\IR^d))$ to the linear equation \eqref{LinearEquation} for $v_0\in L_\mu^2(\IR^d)\cap H^1(\IR^d)$. Denoting as $S_t$ the associated flow, it satisfies
