body:
[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2604.27242, 'Statistical Inference for Homogenization Limits Driven by Wiener or Hermite Processes'] For any \(3/4<H<5/6\) we have that, if \(u>v\)  
\begin{equation}
    \int_u^1 (s-u)^{H-3/2}(s-v)^{2H-2}ds < |u-v|^{3H-5/2}\beta(H-1/2, 5/2-3H)
\end{equation}
whereas if \(v>u\) we have that 
\begin{equation}
    \int_v^1 (s-u)^{H-3/2}(s-v)^{2H-2}ds < |u-v|^{3H-5/2}\beta(2H-1, 5/2-3H) 
\end{equation}

