+ \Delta u \cdot \nabla^{-1} $.  For any $ 2 <\alpha < \beta < \mathbf{a}/2 $, we can estimate uniformly
over $ \kappa \in (0, 1] $ and $ M \geqslant \kappa^{-\mathbf{q}} $:
\begin{equ}
\mathbb{E} \bigl\| \mathcal{L}_{\sqrt{2}}  \bigl[  \Pi^{(1)}S_{t_{\star}^{\kappa} (M)} \bigr] \bigr\|^{2}\lesssim
(t_{\star}^{\kappa} (M))^{4} \kappa^{-1} (\| u_{0}
\|+1)^{4}_{\mathcal{C}^{\beta}} \| \varrho_{0} \|_{H^{- (\alpha+1)}}^{2} \;.
\end{equ}

