By (equation eq:boundF of the paper) and (equation eq:boundR of the paper) we have, for sufficiently small $T>0$, 
\begin{equ}
    \norm{K_{T}\big( F_{\eps,T}[0]+R_{\eps,T}\big)}_{L^\infty_{0;T}}\leqslant C_FT^{-1+H-\eta}\mathcal{G}_{\tt u}(0)+C_RT^{\delta/2}\leqslant2 C_FT^{-1+H-\eta}\mathcal{G}_{\tt u}(0)\,.
\end{equ}
