[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2604.26819, 'Sharp One-\!Dimensional Sub-Gaussian Comparison in Convex Order'] For every $s\ge0$, 
\begin{align}
    \frac{e^s + 2 e^{-s/2}}{3} &\le \exp\paren{ \frac{3s^2}{16\log(2)} } . \notag 
\end{align}

