 \Lambda^{ij}(\mathrm{d} t)(\omega) = \frac{\mathbb{E}_s^i[\mathds{1}_{\{\tau(s) \geq t\}} N^{ij}(\mathrm{d} t )](\omega)}{\mathbb{E}_s^i[\mathds{1}_{\{\tau(s) \geq t\}}](\omega)} 
