for those $t \in (s,\infty)$ such that neither $Z(\cdot )(\omega)$ has a jump in $(s,t)$ nor $\Lambda^{i \raisebox{-0.25ex}{\scalebox{1.4}{$\cdot$}}}(\cdot)(\omega)$ has a pole or a jump of size $+1$ in $(s,t{]}$. 
