[Cor sim of arXiv:2412.03450, 'On intermediate levels of nested occupancy scheme in random environment generated by stick'] Suppose (equation eq:estim of the paper). Then, for all $\gamma>0$,
\begin{equation}
\lim_{t\to\infty}\sup_{y\geq \gamma t}\Big|\frac{V_j(y)}{\rho_j y^{\alpha j} 
}-1\Big|=0
\end{equation}
whenever $j=j(t)$ satisfies $j(t) = o(t^{\frac{\alpha - \beta}{\alpha-\beta +1}})$ as $t \to \infty$, and particularly
\begin{equation}
V_j(t)~\sim~ \rho_j
t^{\alpha j},  \quad t \to \infty.
 \end{equation}

