[Lemma eq:uNmoxest of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assuming (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper) and $\lambda^{(\emptyset)}_{\hash, \infty}$ as in Corollary~(lemma:deltalambda of the paper),  there exists $\tilde{\psi}_N ({\sf x})$ and $\tilde{\psi}_\infty = \lim_{N\rightarrow \infty} \tilde{\psi}_N$ such that
\begin{align}
	u_{N,{\sf ox}} (\Lambda) = - \lambda_{{\sf o},\infty}^{(\emptyset)} \lambda_{{\sf x},\infty}^{(\emptyset)} w_{N} ({\sf x}) + \tilde{\psi}_N ({\sf x})

\end{align}
and satisfy $\lim_{|{\sf x}| \rightarrow \infty} |{\sf x}|^{d-2+\eta} \tilde\psi_N ({\sf x}) = 0$ uniformly in $N$ and $|\tilde{\psi}_\infty ({\sf x}) - \tilde{\psi}_N ({\sf x}) | \le O(L^{-(d-2+\eta)N})$ uniformly in ${\sf x}$.

