\big\Vert_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}^{2}
\Big]^{1/2}
\leq
\\
\sum_{\substack{1\leq j\leq 2(k-q)+1 \\ 0\leq l\leq \lfloor(2(k-q)+1-j)/2\rfloor}}
\dfrac{(2(k-q)+1)!}{2^{l}j!l!(2(k-q)+1-j-2l)!} \times
\\
\times
\E\Big[\big\Vert
f_{0}
\ell_{0,b}^{2(k-q)+1-j-2l}
(\log \CR(z,D))^{q}
V_{A_{0,b}}^{l}
\,:\Phi_{D\setminus A_{0,b}}^{j} :
\ind_{\{z\in A_{0,b}\text{~or~}\ell_{0,b}(z)=b\}}
\big\Vert_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}^{2}
