If $ j > y + 2 $, then for $ s = 1, \dots, \ell $, we have $ j+s-2 - y > 0 $, and the product telescopes:  ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:8e8f27b4b7035824f844d6e6f0b75e91ea0c265c2ea8d199180d9d5fb8ef5f03","revision_digest":"sha256:ab80195dc4b537b4cecbacc10c8c85ec59998dad0e0e7a16e316d5d602cc6f2a","source_id":"arxiv:2607.05054","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

