[Proposition prop:globalsolnest of arXiv:2601.21762, 'Navier-Stokes with a fractional transport noise as a limit of multi-scale dynamics'] Let $u$ be a URD solution to (equation eq:modeleqn of the paper) and $\tilde{L}$ the constant defined by ((eq:Ltilde of the paper)).
    Then $u\in C^{\frac{1}{\alpha}\textrm{-var}}([0,T]; H^{-1})$:
    \begin{equation}
       \left\| u \right\|_{C^{\frac{1}{\alpha}\textrm{-var}}([0,T];H^{-1})}^{\frac{1}{\alpha}} \lesssim \left(\frac{T}{\tilde{L}}\right)^{\frac{1}{\alpha}-1}(1+\left\| u \right\|_{L_T^\infty H})^{\frac{1}{\alpha}}\left[ 
            \omega_\mu^{\frac{1}{\alpha}}(0,T) + \omega_{\mu}^{\frac{1}{3\alpha}}(0,T)\omega_{A}^{\frac 13}(0,T) \right].
    \end{equation}

