   From that proof, without loss, we may assume that the entries of $L_n$ are iid standard Gaussian.  Moreover, $\lim_{n\rightarrow\infty}\varphi_n((n^{-1/2}L_n)^{2m-1})=0$ for all $m\ge1$.  From ((lscegs of the paper)), we have
    \begin{align*}
