[Lemma eq:Phi2 of arXiv:2411.07157, 'Rough differential equations in the flow approach'] Let $T\in(0,1]$ be as in Proposition~(eq:prop1 of the paper). 
Then, for any $\eps \in (0,1]$, 
if $u_\eps$ solves (equation eq:eq1 of the paper) on $[0,T]$, then, for all $t\in[0,T]$, 
    \begin{equs}
        u_\eps(t)=(G-G_{T})\big(F_{\eps,T}[0]+R_{\eps,T}\big)(t)+{\tt u}\,.
    \end{equs}

