		Expanding $(I+A)^{-\alpha} = \exp[-\alpha\log(I+A)]$, we obtain
		\begin{align*}
			&(I+\alpha A)(I+A)^{-\alpha} = (I+\alpha A)\exp[-\alpha \log(I+A)]
