    \item[(1b)] If $\xi^{\modi}_{t_-}(y) \in \{\one,\onep\}$ and $\xi^{\modi}_{t_-}(y+1) = \Aup$, then swap the endpoints.
    \item[(1c)] If $\xi^{\modi}_{t_-}(y) =\Bup$ and $\xi^{\modi}_{t_-}(y+1) = \Aup$, then set $(\xi^{\modi}_{t}(y),\xi^{\modi}_{t}(y+1))=(\zerop,\onep)$,  
