[Lemma lem_extra_path of arXiv:2506.06559, 'Bi-infinite incipient cluster in high dimensions'] { Let $x\in\mathbb{Z}^d$, $W\subset \mathbb{Z}^d$, let {{$E \subset \mathcal{E}_D$}} and $z\in V(E)$. Then }
\begin{align*}
& \Bigl(\{E\text{ is occupied}\}\circ \{x \longleftrightarrow z\} \Bigr)\cap \{W \Leftrightarrow x\}\\
\subset &  \Bigl(\{E\text{ is occupied}\}\circ \{x \longleftrightarrow z\} \circ \{x \longleftrightarrow E\}\Bigr)   \bigcup \Bigl(\{E\text{ is occupied}\}\circ \{x \longleftrightarrow  z\} \circ \{W  \longleftrightarrow  x\}\Bigr).
\end{align*}

