[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2607.07022, 'Coordinate-wise Elephant Random Walk'] With \eqref{eq:mri} and $\alpha_i = 2 p_i -1$ the embedded process $(Y^{(i)}_r)_{r \ge 0}$ in \eqref{eq:Yr} satisfies 
    \begin{equation} 
        \E\left[Y^{(i)}_{r+1}\mid \G^{(i)}_r\right]=\alpha_im^{(i)}_r, \quad r \ge 0 . 
    \end{equation}

