[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2604.01852, 'The on/off Brownian snake'] Let $(\mathcal{Y}^{(\rm d)}_s, \mathcal{Y}^{(\rm a)}_s)_{s \geq 0}$ be the $\text{ooSBM}(4, c, \Tilde{c})$ defined in Corollary \ref{corollary continuous modifications} and let $\delta > 0$. Then,
