[Lemma orbit of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Let $T^{\ast }$ be a cluster inverse. Then $T^{\ast }$ has a
unique interior fixed point $c^{\ast }$, and for any $x\in (0,1)$, 
\begin{equation}
T^{\ast \circ m}(x)\longrightarrow c^{\ast }\quad \text{as }m\rightarrow
\infty .  
\end{equation}

