  $B[G_2; p_0]=\{x: \nu_0(x)=p_0\}$
  is calculated by formula
  \begin{equation}

    \alpha_0(E)=\frac{\ln{p_0^{p_0}p_1^{p_1}}}{\ln g_0^{p_0}(-g_1)^{p_1}}.
