    Let $u \in (0, 1)$, and let $M$ be a positive integer.
    We say that a set $A \subseteq B_{v + e}$ is \textbf{$u$-nice} if 
    $$\max_{\substack{x, y \in A \\ x \neq y}} G_{\ell^*}(x, y) \le u G_{\ell^*}.$$
    We will use the following lemma.
    \begin{lemma} 
        Let $d \ge 2$.
