[Theorem 6 (Perturbed invariant process--measure pair) of arXiv:2604.11434, 'Maxima of stationary systems of randomly time-changed L\'evy particles'] Let $\alpha$ be a mass function satisfying Assumption~\ref{asu:alpha},
  let $(L_t)_{t\ge 0}$ be a L\'evy process satisfying Assumption~\ref{asu:levy},
